# Pictures of the app for sikemux.com, taken by the site's `pnpm shots`: the window alone at 2x,
# in the default theme. The hero, Git and Usage keep the world's picture behind the panes; the
# chats and the terminal show only the dither over the whole pane.
stage 1760 900
window 1760 900
replies replies.json
prefer themeId aura-noir
page c4a7f00d000000000000000000000001 pages/latency.html
page c4a7f00d000000000000000000000002 pages/mockups.html
project storefront shop
patch site-fix.diff
chat Wren
title "Cart totals a cent off"
settle 6
click 871,774
type "Some orders come out a cent off at checkout. Find out why and fix it properly, with a test." 200
key enter
wait 1
# The core times the turn by the clock on the wall, so the work takes a believable while.
hold 40
wait 5
type "Good. Run all the tests, then commit it with a clear message." 200
key enter
wait 3
hold 8
wait 0.5
snap hero
prefer paneImage null
prefer paneCoverage full
prefer paneStrength 1.4
wait 0.5
snap agents
chat Rhea
title "Orders schema"
settle 2
click 871,774
type "draw the database schema so I can see how orders connect" 200
key enter
wait 10
snap visual-diagram
chat Kaito
title "Checkout latency after the fix"
settle 2
click 871,774
type "did the payments fix bring checkout p95 back down?" 200
key enter
wait 6
snap visual-chart
chat Mio
title "Empty projects page"
settle 2
click 871,774
type "sketch the empty projects page three ways before you build it" 200
key enter
wait 6
snap visual-mockup
open terminal
settle 2
type "node --test" 200
key enter
wait 3
snap terminals
prefer paneImage
prefer paneCoverage
prefer paneStrength
open git
settle 2
click 405,181
type "fix(cart): round tax once, on the whole cart" 200
key enter
key enter
type "A cart of cheap items could come out a cent off the receipt. The discount can no longer push the total below zero." 200
wait 0.5
snap git
settings Usage
settle 2
snap activity
